&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge and interest in designer clothing, culture, and trends&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to learn/adapt quickly with proven independent problem-solving skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
